    {
      "field": "/capabilities/0/label",
      "source_id": "readme",
      "quote": "One MCP endpoint for many backends: REST APIs through DADL files and existing MCP servers over HTTP or stdio.",
      "method": "model",
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "checked_at": "2026-11-20T00:58:45+08:00"
    },
    {
      "field": "/capabilities/1/label",
      "source_id": "readme",
      "quote": "A DADL file describes a REST API as MCP tools.",
      "method": "model",
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "checked_at": "2026-11-20T00:58:45+08:00"
    },
    {
      "field": "/capabilities/2/label",
      "source_id": "readme",
      "quote": "ToolMesh reads them from its environment (`CREDENTIAL_<NAME>`) and adds them to the request at call time",
      "method": "model",
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "checked_at": "2026-11-20T00:58:45+08:00"
    },
    {
      "field": "/capabilities/3/label",
      "source_id": "readme",
      "quote": "Each user stores their own on a page of ToolMesh, several accounts if they have them",
      "method": "model",
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "checked_at": "2026-11-20T00:58:45+08:00"
    },
    {
      "field": "/capabilities/4/label",
      "source_id": "readme",
      "quote": "OpenFGA: may this caller call this tool?",
      "method": "model",
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "checked_at": "2026-11-20T00:58:45+08:00"
    },
    {
      "field": "/capabilities/5/label",
      "source_id": "readme",
      "quote": "the agent asks for one, a person approves it, and the grant ends after its time.",
      "method": "model",
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "checked_at": "2026-11-20T00:58:45+08:00"
    },
    {
      "field": "/capabilities/6/label",
      "source_id": "readme",
      "quote": "An audit entry for every call: who called which tool with which parameters",
      "method": "model",
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "checked_at": "2026-11-20T00:58:45+08:00"
    },
    {
      "field": "/capabilities/7/label",
      "source_id": "readme",
      "quote": "with `AUDIT_STORE=sqlite` in a database you can query with SQL.",
      "method": "model",
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "checked_at": "2026-11-20T00:58:45+08:00"
    },
    {
      "field": "/capabilities/8/label",
      "source_id": "readme",
      "quote": "The model sees two tools, `discover_tools` and `execute_code`",
      "method": "model",
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "checked_at": "2026-11-20T00:58:45+08:00"
    },
    {
      "field": "/capabilities/9/label",
      "source_id": "readme",
      "quote": "Optional JavaScript policies that check a call before it runs and filter its result, for example to redact personal data.",
      "method": "model",
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "checked_at": "2026-11-20T00:58:45+08:00"
    },
    {
      "field": "/capabilities/10/label",
      "source_id": "readme",
      "quote": "With `hint_required_for`, writes are refused until the agent shows that it has received the hint",
      "method": "model",
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "checked_at": "2026-11-20T00:58:45+08:00"
    },
    {
      "field": "/capabilities/11/label",
      "source_id": "readme",
      "quote": "authenticate     OAuth 2.1 or API key",
      "method": "model",
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "checked_at": "2026-11-20T00:58:45+08:00"
    },
    {
      "field": "/capabilities/12/label",
      "source_id": "readme",
      "quote": "how the API authenticates (bearer token, API key, OAuth2, session login)",
      "method": "model",
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "checked_at": "2026-11-20T00:58:45+08:00"
    },
    {
      "field": "/capabilities/13/label",
      "source_id": "readme",
      "quote": "`TOOLMESH_TLS_ACME=true` gets a Let's Encrypt certificate",
      "method": "model",
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "checked_at": "2026-11-20T00:58:45+08:00"
    },
    {
      "field": "/capabilities/14/label",
      "source_id": "readme",
      "quote": "With `CREDENTIAL_STORE=command` ToolMesh takes the credentials from a command, such as a sops decryption",
      "method": "model",
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "checked_at": "2026-11-20T00:58:45+08:00"
    },
    {
      "field": "/capabilities/15/label",
      "source_id": "readme",
      "quote": "Prometheus metrics are served on a separate, unauthenticated listener.",
      "method": "model",
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "checked_at": "2026-11-20T00:58:45+08:00"
    },
    {
      "field": "/capabilities/16/label",
      "source_id": "readme",
      "quote": "Existing MCP servers, over HTTP or stdio, sit behind the same endpoint.",
      "method": "model",
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "checked_at": "2026-11-20T00:58:45+08:00"
    },
    {
      "field": "/capabilities/17/label",
